Text Classification and Naive Bayes

1. Data ------------------------------

The Reuters-21578 dataset is a collection of documents with news articles.
The original corpus has 10,369 documents and a vocabulary of 29,930 words.
- 21,578 documents
- 9603 training, 3299 test articles
- 118 categories
    -- an article can be in more than one category
    -- average class has how many categories

Total N of articles : 21 578
Total N of articles with topics : 11 367

Optional tags : title, people, orgs, exchanges, and companies.

