2. Load, preprocess and explore data ------------------------------
First load : data is loaded as *sgm files and saved to pickle files.
Other than first load : data is loaded from pickle file as dataframe.

Out of all available information (tags), only below fields are used for the analysis:
id - numeric id of the entry, created within current task
file - original *sgm file that contains the article
split - split as per original data
topic - topic of the article as per original data
article - original article text
text - cleaned article text

Frequency of articles is plotted as bar chart.
It is possible for article to be associated with
- no topic (those entries are out scoped)
- one topic
- multiple topics.
For bar chart, we visualize the frequency of individual topic per se, not combinations of topics as present
in the original data.

